"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-submit has-spinner button thm-btn comment-form__btn\" type=\"submit\" value=\"提交\" /> </p> </div> </div>\n</div><div class=\"wpcf7-response-output\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</form>\n</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <footer class=\"footer\"> <div class=\"footer-contacts-nav\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"row row-30\"> <div class=\"col-md-8 col-sm-24 \"> <div class=\"footer-contacts\"> <h3>联系我们</h3> <div> <p>地 址: 烟台市牟平区大窑沁水工业园天华大街186号</p> <p>销售电话: 总机4838688-1</p> <p>招聘电话: 0535-4838688-3</p> <p>营销中心: 0535-4838688</p> <p>销售经理：+8615053525100</p> <p>传 真: 0535-3397708</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-md-16 col-sm-12 hidden-xs hidden-sm\"> <div> <ul class=\"b-menu\"> <li class=\"m-0 has-sub \"> <a href=\"/guanyuxingye/\" title=\"关于兴业\">关于兴业</a> <ul class=\"sub-btn\"> <li><a href=\"/guanyuxingye/#a1\" title=\"公司简介\">公司简介</a></li> <li><a href=\"/guanyuxingye/#a2\" title=\"兴业文化\">兴业文化</a></li> <li><a href=\"/guanyuxingye/#a3\" title=\"资质荣誉\">资质荣誉</a></li> <li><a href=\"/guanyuxingye/#a4\" title=\"发展历程\">发展历程</a></li> </ul> </li> <li class=\"m-1 has-sub \"> <a href=\"/pro_category/products/\" title=\"产品展示\">产品展示</a> <ul class=\"sub-btn\"> <li><a href=\"/pro_category/chanyunjixilie/\" title=\"铲运机系列\">铲运机系列</a></li> <li><a href=\"/pro_category/yunkuangkache/\" title=\"矿卡系列\">矿卡系列</a></li> <li><a href=\"/pro_category/zaoyantaiche/\" title=\"凿岩系列\">凿岩系列</a></li> <li><a href=\"/pro_category/yidongshiqiaomaotaiche/\" title=\"撬毛碎石机系列\">撬毛碎石机系列</a></li> <li><a href=\"/pro_category/dexiafuwuche/\" title=\"服务车系列\">服务车系列</a></li> </ul> </li> <li class=\"m-2 has-sub \"> <a href=\"/fuwuzhichi/\" title=\"服务支持\">服务支持</a> <ul class=\"sub-btn\"> <li><a href=\"/fuwuzhichi/#a1\" title=\"产品质量\">产品质量</a></li> <li><a href=\"/fuwuzhichi/#a2\" title=\"售后服务\">售后服务</a></li> </ul> </li> <li class=\"m-3 has-sub \"> <a href=\"/pro_category/beijianzhongxin/\" title=\"备件中心\">备件中心</a> <ul class=\"sub-btn\"> <li><a href=\"/pro_category/yeyajian/\" title=\"液压件\">液压件</a></li> <li><a href=\"/pro_category/dianqijian/\" title=\"电器件\">电器件</a></li> <li><a href=\"/pro_category/donglichuandongjian/\" title=\"动力传动件\">动力传动件</a></li> <li><a href=\"/pro_category/qita/\" title=\"其他\">其他</a></li> </ul> </li> <li class=\"m-4 has-sub \"> <a href=\"/lianxiwomen/\" title=\"联系我们\">联系我们</a> <ul class=\"sub-btn\"> <li><a href=\"/lianxiwomen/#a1\" title=\"联系我们\">联系我们</a></li> <li><a href=\"/lianxiwomen/#a2\" title=\"在线留言\">在线留言</a></li> </ul> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"footer-contacts-nav1\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"row row-30\"> <div class=\"col-md-18 col-sm-14 \"> <div class=\"footer-contacts\"> <div style=\"padding-top:40px;\"> <a href=\"/faluwenjian/1361/\">隐私政策</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/faluwenjian/1362/\">广告法声明</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/faluwenjian/1363/\">法律声明</a> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-14 hidden-sm\"> <div> <ul class=\"b-menu\"> <li><img src=\"https://snapshot.local/wp-content/themes/phoenix/static/images/dy.jpg\" width=\"130\" /></li> <li><img src=\"https://snapshot.local/wp-content/themes/phoenix/static/images/wx.jpg\" width=\"130\" /></li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"container-fluid footer-copy\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-md-8 footer-copy-col1\"> <div class=\"txt01\"><a href=\"/\" style=\"color:#fff;\">长沙仁毅机械有限公司</a></div> <div class=\"txt02\">YANTAI XINGYE MACHINERY CO.,LTD</div> </div> <div class=\"col-md-16 footer-copy-col2\"> <span><a href=\"/\">长沙仁毅机械有限公司</a></span><span><a href=\"https://beian.miit.gov.cn/\" target=\" _blank\">鲁ICP备2024129649号-2</a></span><span> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.beian.gov.cn/portal/registerSystemInfo?recordcode=37061202000300\" style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;height:20px;line-height:20px;\"><img src=\"https://snapshot.local/wp-content/themes/phoenix/static/images/gongan.png\" style=\"float:left;\"/><p style=\"float:left;height:20px;line-height:20px;margin: 0px 0px 0px 5px; color:#939393;\">鲁公网安备 37061202000300号</p><br clear=\"all\"/></a> </span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </footer> </div> <div class=\"right-float hidden-xs hidden-sm\"> <a class=\"goto-top\" href=\"javascript:;\" style=\"display: block;\"><i><svg class=\"icon\" style=\"width: 1em;height: 1em;vertical-align: middle;fill: currentColor;overflow: hidden;\" viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"8240\"><path d=\"M887.475 762.313 512 386.843l-375.474 375.47L73.947 699.74 512 261.687 950.053 699.74 887.475 762.313z\" p-id=\"8241\"></path></svg></i></a> </div>"
